data: {"type":"response.output_item.done","item":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"toolu_bdrk_01JfZv5xsdQRzosH8avpWZW7","output":" 1  # CIBG Coverage Model 2026\n 2  \n 3  ## Metadata\n 4  - Domain: cibg\n 5  - Category: customers\n 6  - Tags: coverage-model, CBC, network, RM, sector-focus\n 7  - Last updated: 2026-05-07\n 8  - Source: AP26 CIBG Round 2 (EN)_Nov,25 sent.pdf\n 9  \n10  ## Summary\n11  CIBG's 2026 coverage model restructures the network from 23 CBCs in 11 provinces to 21 CBCs in 7 provinces (2 HO, 17 MMU, 2 FDI), with stronger sector involvement in client coverage, leaner network, and standardized RM/GTS profiles.\n12  \n13  ## Detail\n14  \n15  ### Network Structure\n16  \n17  The 2026 CIBG network consists of 21 Corporate Banking Centers (CBCs):\n18  - **2 CBC HO**: HO 1 (North), HO 2 (South)\n19  - **17 CBC MMU**: HSO1, HSO2, DDA1, DDA2, TLG, HPG, BAN, NBH, HCM1, HCM2, CLN1, CLN2, QTN, DNG, BHD, DAI, BPC\n20  - **2 CBC FDI**: FDI North, FDI South\n21  \n22  **Geographic coverage** (7 key provinces/cities):\n23  - North: Ha Noi, Bac Ninh, Hai Phong, Ninh Binh\n24  - Central: Da Nang, Quy Nhon\n25  - South: HCM, Binh Duong, Dong Nai, Long An, Can Tho\n26  \n27  ### Key Design Principles\n28  \n29  | Principle | Description |\n30  |-----------|-------------|\n31  | Stronger Sector involvement | Sectors define financial targets, identify specialized RMs/CBCs, participate in solution development and KPI evaluation |\n32  | Leaner network | Concentrate resources in provinces with highest potential; maintain 7 key provinces |\n33  | RM & GTS profile standardization | Executive RM, Senior RM, S-Advisor, Advisor, S-Expert, Expert |\n34  \n35  ### Sector Focus by CBC\n36  \n37  Each CBC specializes in specific sectors:\n38  - **Real Estate (RE)**: 4 CBCs\n39  - **Infrastructure (INFRAS)**: 10 CBCs\n40  - **Diversified Industry (DI)**: 16 CBCs\n41  - **Healthcare**: 9 CBCs\n42  - **Financial Institutions (FI)**: 4 CBCs\n43  - **Transport & Logistics (T&L)**: 9 CBCs\n44  \n45  ### Sales Coverage Model\n46  \n47  | Role | Function |\n48  |------|----------|\n49  | Executive RM | Senior client relationships for VVIP/key accounts |\n50  | Senior RM | Primary relationship management |\n51  | S-Advisor / Advisor | Specialized advisory for sectors |\n52  | S-Expert / Expert | Deep domain expertise |\n53  \n54  ### Service & Operation Model\n55  \n56  - Sales Coverage → Underwriting → Service & Operations\n57  - Sector-led approach: sectors define strategy, CBCs execute\n58  - Mini-CST model for key accounts\n59  \n60  ### Key Changes from Previous Model\n61  \n62  1. Reinforce CBC presence in Hung Yen, Can Tho, Quy Nhon, Nha Trang\n63  2. Strengthen CBC effort in HN and HCM for effective customer management\n64  3. Establish CBC FDI focus on FDI customers\n65  4. Continue deepening sectoral specialization based on core capabilities\n66  5. CBC HNM moves to Ninh Binh and renames to CBC NBH\n67  \n68  ## See Also\n69  - [[cibg-sector-strategy]]\n70  - [[cibg-operating-model]]\n71  \n72  ## Change History\n73  | Date | Change | Source |\n74  |------|--------|--------|\n75  | 2026-05-07 | Initial creation from AP26 CIBG Round 2 | AP26 CIBG Round 2 (EN)_Nov,25 sent.pdf |","duration_ms":0}}

