data: {"type":"response.output_item.done","item":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"comp_cbf0f340","output":"{\"summary\": \"You are continuing a conversation after context compaction.\\n\\n<compacted_history>\\n## REQUEST\\n\\nGiám đốc CBC CLN 1 (khối CIBG, TPHCM) yêu cầu báo cáo hiệu suất HTML toàn diện, tự chứa, interactive, gồm 4 phần:\\n\\n1. **Tổng quan**: TOI/NII/NFI actual vs budget vs SPLY; Balance (CASA/TD/CD/ST/MLT/FX Spot); Customers tại Jun 2026 (NTB, Active vs budget vs YoY)\\n2. **Phân tích sản phẩm**: CASA, TD, CD, ST, MLT — driver/logic-tree (rate × volume)\\n3. **So sánh CBC CLN 1 vs HCM1/HCM2/CLN2** — positioning, strengths, gaps\\n4. **Forecast H2/2026 + Recommendations** — action cards với market signals\\n\\nKỳ: Jan–Jun 2026 actual, full-year 2026 budget, SPLY Jan–Jun 2025, forecast Jul–Dec 2026. Đơn vị: tỷ VND. Output: `build_report` → file HTML.\\n\\nKhông được lặp lại lỗi: không tự suy diễn số liệu — phải dùng `compute_measures` trước rồi bind qua `{{measure}}` tokens.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## FINDINGS\\n\\n### P&L — CBC CLN 1 YTD Jan–Jun 2026 (nguồn: `/evidence/wi_cibg_d5634de6/data.md`)\\n\\nMonthly actuals (tỷ VND):\\n- Jan: TOI 32.53, NII 18.61, NFI 5.79\\n- Feb: TOI 27.64, NII 17.28, NFI 3.59\\n- Mar: TOI 41.95, NII 20.42, NFI 6.60\\n- Apr: TOI 39.99, NII 19.17, NFI 4.24\\n- May: TOI 50.75, NII 18.92, NFI 3.01\\n- Jun: TOI 38.20, NII 20.27, NFI 4.32\\n\\nYTD TOI actual = 32.53+27.64+41.95+39.99+50.75+38.20 = **231.06 tỷ**\\nYTD NII actual = 18.61+17.28+20.42+19.17+18.92+20.27 = **114.67 tỷ**\\nYTD NFI actual = 5.79+3.59+6.60+4.24+3.01+4.32 = **27.55 tỷ**\\n\\nMonthly budget Jan–Jun: Jan 28.51, Feb 28.46, Mar 31.10, Apr 29.01, May 29.57, Jun 30.96\\nYTD TOI budget = **177.61 tỷ**\\nNII budget YTD = 18.09+17.50+19.47+18.83+19.62+19.21 = **112.72 tỷ**\\nNFI budget YTD = 4.89+4.71+4.41+4.16+4.65+5.26 = **28.08 tỷ**\\n\\nSPLY Jan–Jun 2025: Jan 28.33, Feb 24.59, Mar 26.79, Apr 19.86, May 25.16, Jun 23.04\\nYTD TOI SPLY = **147.77 tỷ**\\n\\nTOI